## DETECTION & PREVENTION

### Pre-commit Hook (Prevent accidental commits)
```bash
#!/bin/bash
# .git/hooks/pre-commit

echo "Checking for secrets..."

# Check for common secret patterns
if git diff --cached | grep -iE '(password|secret|key|token|api_key|aws_secret).*=' ; then
  echo "❌ DENIED: Potential secrets detected in staged changes"
  exit 1
fi

# Check for .env files
if git diff --cached --name-only | grep -E '\.env' ; then
  echo "❌ DENIED: .env files cannot be committed"
  exit 1
fi

echo "✓ Secrets check passed"
exit 0
```

Make it executable:
```bash
chmod +x .git/hooks/pre-commit
```

