| **Authentication** | ❌ None | ✅ JWT-based | Middleware verifies tokens |
| **Authorization** | ❌ None | ✅ Protected endpoints | authenticateToken middleware |
| **Input Validation** | ❌ None | ✅ express-validator | Validates and sanitizes input |
| **NoSQL Injection** | ❌ Vulnerable | ✅ Protected | mongo-sanitize middleware |
| **CORS** | ❌ Allow all | ✅ Whitelist-based | CORS middleware with origin check |
| **Security Headers** | ❌ None | ✅ Complete set | helmet.js + custom headers |
