| **Request Size** | ❌ Unlimited | ✅ 1MB limit | express.json({ limit: '1mb' }) |
| **PII Protection** | ❌ Exposed | ✅ Minimized | Only return necessary fields |
| **Secrets** | ❌ Hardcoded | ✅ Environment vars | Uses dotenv, validates on start |
