      "param": "limit"
    }
  ]
}
```

### Scenario 4: Clickjacking Attack
**Before:**
```html
<!-- Attacker can frame the page -->
<iframe src="http://localhost:3000"></iframe>
<!-- No X-Frame-Options header to prevent this -->
```

**After:**
```http
X-Frame-Options: DENY
<!-- Browser prevents framing -->
<!-- Clickjacking attack blocked -->
```

---

## Performance Impact

| Feature | Overhead | Notes |
|---------|----------|-------|
| JWT Validation | ~2ms | Negligible |
| Input Validation | ~1ms | Per request |
| Rate Limiting | <1ms | Memory-based tracking |
| Security Headers | <1ms | Added to response |
| CORS | <1ms | Preflight for non-GET |
| Logging | ~5-10ms | Async to file |
| **Total** | **~10-15ms** | **Acceptable for security** |

The security improvements have minimal performance impact and are worthwhile trade-offs.

