## STEP 12: Data Protection

### Field-Level Permissions
```javascript
// Before (Exposes all data)
app.get('/users/:id', authenticateToken, (req, res) => {
  res.json({
    id: 1,
    name: 'Alice',
    email: 'alice@example.com',
    phone: '555-1234',
    ssn: '123-45-6789', // EXPOSED!
  });
});

// After (Protects sensitive fields)
app.get('/users/:id', authenticateToken, (req, res) => {
  let user = {
    id: 1,
    name: 'Alice',
    email: 'alice@example.com',
    phone: '555-1234',
    ssn: '123-45-6789',
  };

  // Only expose sensitive data if authorized
  if (req.user.id !== user.id && req.user.role !== 'admin') {
    delete user.email;
    delete user.phone;
    delete user.ssn;
  }

  res.json(user);
});
```

