- User enumeration attack possible

**OWASP:** A01:2021 - Broken Access Control, A02:2021 - Cryptographic Failures

**Recommendation:**
```javascript
app.get('/users', authenticate, (req, res) => {
  // Return limited fields by default
  const users = [
    { id: 1, name: 'Alice' }, // Remove email
    { id: 2, name: 'Bob' },
  ];
  res.json(users);
});

// Separate endpoint for full user details with stricter auth
app.get('/users/:id/profile', authenticate, authorize('view_user_profile'), (req, res) => {
  // Only return own profile or with admin role
  if (req.user.id !== parseInt(req.params.id) && req.user.role !== 'admin') {
    return res.status(403).json({ error: 'Forbidden' });
  }
  res.json({
    id: 1,
    name: 'Alice',
    email: 'alice@example.com'
  });
});
```

