**Vulnerable Code:**
```javascript
// No input validation, direct responses
app.get('/users', (req, res) => {
  res.json(userData);
});
```

**Fixed Code:**
```javascript
// Validated inputs, sanitized outputs
app.get('/users',
  query('limit').isInt({ min: 1, max: 100 }),
  (req, res) => {
    const errors = validationResult(req);
    if (!errors.isEmpty()) {
      return res.status(400).json({ errors: errors.array() });
    }
    // Safe response
  }
);
```

**Status:** ✅ FIXED

