9. DATA EXPOSURE - UNNECESSARY FIELDS
================================================================================

❌ VULNERABLE:
```javascript
app.get('/users', authenticate, (req, res) => {
  // Returning all fields for all users
  res.json([
    { id: 1, name: 'Alice', email: 'alice@example.com', passwordHash: '...' },
