/**
 * HARDENED VERSION OF APP.JS WITH SECURITY BEST PRACTICES
 * 
 * This version implements:
 * - Authentication & Authorization
 * - Input Validation
 * - Security Headers
 * - Rate Limiting
 * - CORS Configuration
 * - Logging & Monitoring
 * - Proper Error Handling
 * - Environment Configuration
