### Automated Testing
```bash
# Install security testing tools
npm install --save-dev snyk nsp
npm run snyk test
npm run nsp
```

### Manual Testing
- Test authentication bypass attempts
- Attempt injection attacks (XSS, SQL)
- Verify CORS restrictions
- Check security headers with: https://securityheaders.com/
- Validate HTTPS enforcement

### OWASP Top 10 Mapping
- A01: Broken Access Control → Add auth & CORS
- A02: Cryptographic Failures → Use HTTPS + secure cookies
- A03: Injection → Add input validation
- A04: Insecure Design → Add security requirements
- A05: Security Misconfiguration → Use helmet + env config
- A07: Identification and Authentication Failures → JWT + MFA
- A09: Security Logging and Monitoring → Winston logger

