| No CORS | Credential theft | HIGH |
| No Rate Limiting | DoS, brute force | MEDIUM |
| No Authorization | Privilege escalation | HIGH |
| No Logging | Can't detect attacks | MEDIUM |
| No HTTPS | Man-in-the-middle | HIGH |
| No Payload Limits | DoS | MEDIUM |

