## Summary of Priority Fixes

| Priority | Vulnerability | Fix |
|----------|---|---|
| 🔴 CRITICAL | Hardcoded secrets | Use environment variables with dotenv |
| 🔴 CRITICAL | No authentication | Implement JWT or session-based auth |
| 🔴 CRITICAL | No HTTPS | Enforce HTTPS in production |
| 🟠 HIGH | No security headers | Add helmet middleware |
| 🟠 HIGH | Sensitive data exposure | Filter response data by permissions |
| 🟠 HIGH | No rate limiting | Add express-rate-limit middleware |
| 🟠 HIGH | No logging | Implement winston/morgan for audit logs |
| 🟡 MEDIUM | No input validation | Add express-validator |
| 🟡 MEDIUM | CORS not configured | Configure cors properly |
| 🟡 MEDIUM | No error handling | Add global error handler |

