## Security Audit Checklist

- [ ] All secrets are externalized (not in code)
- [ ] .env files are in .gitignore
- [ ] .env.example has no actual values
- [ ] All required secrets are validated on startup
- [ ] Secrets are minimum length (32+ characters for keys)
- [ ] Database passwords are strong (16+ chars, mixed case, numbers, symbols)
- [ ] API keys are scoped to minimum permissions
- [ ] Secrets are rotated regularly (every 30-90 days)
- [ ] Expired/revoked secrets are immediately replaced
- [ ] Secret access is logged and monitored
- [ ] Different secrets for dev/staging/prod
- [ ] Developers never have production secrets locally
- [ ] CI/CD only accesses secrets via secure injection
- [ ] Secrets are encrypted in transit and at rest

