1. MISSING AUTHENTICATION & AUTHORIZATION (CRITICAL)
================================================================================

VULNERABILITY:
- Both endpoints (/health and /users) are completely unauthenticated
- No authorization checks present
- Anyone can access sensitive user data without credentials

