|---|---|
| **#1 Broken Access Control** | Add JWT authentication + role-based authorization |
| **#2 Cryptographic Failures** | Use HTTPS, hash passwords with bcrypt, escape output |
| **#3 Injection** | Use express-validator to validate ALL inputs |
| **#4 Insecure Design** | Apply Helmet, configure CORS, set security headers |
| **#5 Security Misconfiguration** | Use dotenv, enable HTTPS, hide stack traces in prod |
| **#6 Vulnerable Components** | Run `npm audit` regularly, update dependencies |
| **#7 Authentication Failures** | Implement rate limiting, use strong tokens |
| **#8 Software/Data Integrity** | Validate inputs, verify JWT signatures |
| **#9 Logging & Monitoring** | Log all security events to file/database |
| **#10 SSRF** | Validate URLs, whitelist endpoints, use firewalls |

